---
---
<section class="section-final-portfolio" id="inquiry">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="fpi-wrapper">
      
      <div class="fpi-content">
        <span class="fpi-eyebrow">Proiectul dumneavoastră</span>
        <h2 class="fpi-title">
          Ce ar trebui să realizeze prezența companiei dumneavoastră?
        </h2>
        <p class="fpi-desc">
          Indiferent dacă planificați un nou website, o relansare sau o prezență mai largă, spuneți-ne unde vă aflați și ce doriți să obțineți. Gabriel Pop va analiza personal situația.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Split Actions with Sharp Structural Lines -->
      <div class="fpi-actions">
        
        <div class="action-route">
          <span class="action-num">01.</span>
          <a href="/contact/" class="action-link">
            Discutați un proiect similar
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
              <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="action-route">
          <span class="action-num">02.</span>
          <a href="/#solutions" class="action-link">
            Vedeți soluțiile
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"></line>
              <polyline points="19 12 12 19 5 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
        
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-final-portfolio {
    padding: 8rem 0;
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  .fpi-wrapper {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .fpi-content {
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
  }

  .fpi-eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--brand-purple);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .fpi-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--brand-navy);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .fpi-desc {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 700px;
  }

  .fpi-actions {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--brand-navy);
    padding-top: 3rem;
  }

  .action-route {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .action-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .action-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    width: 100%;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--brand-navy);
    text-decoration: none;
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    transition: border-color 0.3s, color 0.3s;
  }
  
  .action-link:hover {
    color: var(--brand-purple);
    border-color: var(--brand-purple);
  }

  .action-link svg {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    transition: transform 0.3s;
  }
  .action-link:hover svg {
    transform: translateX(6px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .fpi-actions {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>

